Package: SCutils
Type: Package
Title: Single-Cell RNA-seq Utility Functions
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("José Manuel", "García Sánchez", email = "", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A collection of utility functions for single-cell RNA-seq analysis,
    including quality control metrics, visualization tools with gradient color
    scales, and GSEA-based cluster annotation helpers. Built to complement
    Seurat-based workflows.
